  "goodToKnow": "Die Untersuchungshaft (U-Haft) is custody pending trial, or remand. A judge (Haftrichter) can order it if there is strong suspicion and a reason such as Fluchtgefahr (flight risk), Verdunkelungsgefahr (risk of tampering with evidence) or, for serious crimes, risk of reoffending. Suspects must be brought before a judge by the end of the day after arrest. It has no plural."
